Dear Justice Committee Secretariat,

I write to notify the Committee that Judicial Review proceedings have been =
issued and served in the matter Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & H=
MCTS (AC-2025-LON-004293).

The claim raises matters of systemic concern within the justice system, inc=
luding:

=E2=80=A2 the alleged misadministration of court-controlled electronic material w=
ith potential criminal relevance;
=E2=80=A2 failures within HMCTS=E2=80=99s administrative processes; and
=E2=80=A2 failures to identify, record, and implement participation measures for =
a disabled and clinically vulnerable court user.

The Secretary of State for Justice (in his capacity as Lord Chancellor) is =
a named defendant.
Given the Committee=E2=80=99s oversight of the Ministry of Justice and the courts=
 system, I provide this notification for transparency.

A public archive of officially filed documents is available at:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Yours faithfully,
Nadia Zahmoul

